  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Modernizacin Tecnolgica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technological Upgrading Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENHANCE COMPETITIVENESS PRODUCTIVE ACTIVITIES THROUGH:IMPROVEMENT OF MAINTENANCE AND ENLARGING NATIONAL SCIENTIFIC AND TECHNOLOGICAL RESEARCH CAPACITIES; IMPROVING LINKS BETWEEN RESEARCH CENTERS AND PRODUCTIVE SECTOR; PROMOTION OF TECHNOLOGICAL INNOVATIONS IN PRODUCTIVE SECTOR. PROGRAM INCLUDES 22S SUBPROGRAMMS: SCIENTIFIC RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT AND TECHNOLOGY TRANSFER AND CREDIT FOR INNOVATION IN THE PRODUCTIVE SECTOR.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
